{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y为了突出重点压缩了部分心理动机，例如S04想说出口是希望留住眼下的美好、S13想藏回喜欢是为了减少未来受伤的痛苦，这些因果关系在X里交代得更完整。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"作为边听边扫的普通观众，Y的关键词加亮、话与感受交替、感受按乐句出现，让我更容易迅速抓住每段发生了什么，也不必同时处理X左边的长句和右边大量并列短词。Y反复使用小船、水波、摇荡、暗流、浪和锚等意象，把十四段串成一条连续的情绪体验，而且感受与具体音乐变化结合得更细腻。X的优势是心理解释更完整，尤其能让我理解人物为什么犹豫、为什么反复收回喜欢；因此Y胜在观众实际接收体验，X胜在动机交代的充分程度。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "0acf5675-6093-431e-b9e0-bc9d686354c2", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T051840064774Z", "elapsed_seconds": 59.031, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T05:19:39.115794+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "8ea46f9e677791c7cf3adccfc0637ed3cce9e91dd7a0c4d814d619553917d484", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc42223